7820507549696", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119707042101244232", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@pcshipp I really like my Dot", "url": "https://x.com/SteveGalvisX/status/2119761736236491015"}, {"author_id": "1941151648589434880", "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:37:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119756367749677482"], "id": "2119756367749677482", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 530, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Apple $AAPL Wants to Turn Siri Into a Proactive AI Agent Similar to ChatGPT Dots: Bloomberg\n\u2800\n\u2022 New CEO John Ternus is pushing for faster AI development, moving Siri beyond individual commands toward autonomous, multistep tasks.\n\u2022 iOS 27.3 adds deeper in-app controls across", "url": "https://x.com/allday_stocks/status/2119756367749677482"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119756073078755328"]}, "author_id": "1306359926164516864", "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:36:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119756076685881529"], "id": "2119756076685881529", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 8067, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "APPLE WANTS TO TURN SIRI INTO A TRUE AI AGENT, SIMILAR TO CHATGPT DOTS: BLOOMBERG\n\n$AAPL's new CEO John Ternus is pushing software chief Craig Federighi to accelerate its AI roadmap and move beyond a Siri that primarily responds to individual commands.\n\nWith iOS 27.3, Siri is https://t.co/MnvzCcOt8a", "url": "https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2119756076685881529"}, {"author_id": "2832569740", "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:33:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119755331601588494"], "id": "2119755331601588494", "in_reply_to_user_id": "19040862", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119730689788792954", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@gokhankurt I\u2019m also frustrated by the excessively rapid token consumption when using @Figma MCP. I\u2019m already providing a highly streamlined, clutter-free set of data. Honestly, I\u2019ve been managing things using my own @ChatGPT #Dots and @bot  instead.", "url": "https://x.com/kudretocom/status/2119755331601588494"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119753646430674944"]}, "author_id": "2116855896982843394", "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:27:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119753666177466835"], "id": "2119753666177466835", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Don't wait for xAI to open up Grok Bot. The open-source version just took No. 1 on GitHub's daily trending list.\n\nOpenMausBot puts a whole team of AI bots on your own computer. Each bot is a real Claude or Codex running locally, with its own personality, its own model, its own https://t.co/lBFmFPGOaz", "url": "https://x.com/ROSEdoqj/status/2119753666177466835"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119746861426974720"]}, "author_id": "266102352", "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:00:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119746871455563938"], "id": "2119746871455563938", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenMausBot is an open-source alternative to Grok Bot and a local-first open counterpart to tools like Meta Muse, OpenAI dots, and Cue by Manus. It provides a chat-style interface...\n\nmilind-soni/OpenMausBot is No. 3 on GitHub Trending today.\n\n18,875 stars \u00b7 TypeScript https://t.co/8yxCzb7qci", "url": "https://x.com/chinchoukou/status/2119746871455563938"}, {"author_id": "2021089913467437059", "created_at": "2026-11-09T